    "headline": "JAGUAR AT KNIGHTSBRIDGE: A PERMANENT EXPRESSION OF A NEW ERA",
    "meta": "8 October 2026",
    "deck": null,
    "lead-image": "https://media.production.jlrms.com/styles/hero_crop/s3/2026-10-08/image/57e83fe7-f10a-48ff-8b5a-0f2d4b4e7935/ACT_1054_01289-Edit.jpg?VersionId=wW.I962lXQGL5MO1Oz9C.1b1fOXlAHqv&h=f695478f&itok=VrpXMj8Z",
    "downloads": [
      "https://media.production.jlrms.com/download_archives/66608fd1-c622-4bf8-abac-6be123697bda/en-gb/jaguar-at-knightsbri.zip?VersionId=yGWD7vnNQl4K..J3KGF0uoxKLcZUw3bg",
      "https://www.addtoany.com/share#url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.production.jlrms.com%2Fdownload_archives%2F66608fd1-c622-4bf8-abac-6be123697bda%2Fen-gb%2Fjaguar-at-knightsbri.zip%3FVersionId%3DyGWD7vnNQl4K..J3KGF0uoxKLcZUw3bg&title=%0A%3Cspan%3EJAGUAR%20AT%20KNIGHTSBRIDGE%3A%20A%20PERMANENT%20EXPRESSION%20OF%20A%20NEW%20ERA%3C%2Fspan%3E%0A"
    ],
    "body": [
      "LONDON, UK, 08 OCTOBER 2026: Jaguar at Knightsbridge is open. A dramatic new destination in the heart of London, marking the first permanent physical expression of a radically reimagined brand. Created as a destination for clients and visitors, it brings Jaguar to life through design, culture, artistry, hospitality and personalised commissioning.",
      "Jaguar at Knightsbridge changes the way clients interact with the brand. Architecture, art, light, sound, taste and design come together in a gallery‑inspired environment that feels immersive, expressive and distinctly Jaguar. A stage for artistic collaborations, cultural events and individual commissioning consultations, inviting visitors to experience Jaguar on entirely new terms.",
      "At the heart of the destination is Café Eighty‑One, Jaguar's new hospitality concept. Open throughout the day, it offers original hospitality inspired by modern British culture, providing a welcoming social setting for clients, visitors and the Knightsbridge community.",
      "Jaguar has selected Lithia UK as the retail partner for its Knightsbridge flagship. A long‑standing JLR partner, Lithia UK brings significant experience in luxury retail, including operation of the Land Rover boutique in Mayfair.",
      "The opening reconnects Jaguar with an important chapter in its London heritage. Jaguar at Knightsbridge opens 91 years after the first SS Jaguar was introduced in 1935 around the corner in Mayfair. That same spirit of originality and reinvention now shapes a new home for Jaguar, connecting this heritage with its modern vision.",
      "Jaguar at Knightsbridge is complemented by a refreshed retail network across the UK, giving clients nationwide access to new Jaguar vehicles, commissioning expertise and ownership services.",
      "Each location will deliver a more personal, tailored experience, helping clients create a Jaguar that reflects their individual tastes and aspirations. Jaguar Care will support that with proactive assistance, personalised service and greater flexibility throughout their relationship with the brand.",
      "Jaguar's commitment to existing owners is unchanged. Clients will continue to benefit from nationwide support through Jaguar's Authorised Repairer network, alongside access to Jaguar Approved Used vehicles through Jaguar Pre‑Owned Sales locations across the UK.",
      "Jaguar at Knightsbridge is located at 81‑93 Knightsbridge, London SW1X 8ET.",
      "Explore the new era of Jaguar at: www.jaguar.com/copy‑nothing"
    ],
    "gallery": [],
    "further-information": [
      "Media Contacts: Tracey Tompsett, PR Manager traceytompsett@jaguarlandrover.com Charlene Guy, Senior Press Officer cguy2@jaguarlandrover.com",
      "Jaguar site: www.jaguar.com/copy‑nothing",
      "Social Channels: Facebook: @JaguarKnightsbridgeTikTok: @jaguarknightsbridge"
    ],
    "notes-to-editors": [
      "ABOUT JAGUAR Jaguar inspires like no other. Since 1935, it has been at its best when looking forward. A copy of nothing.",
      "Jaguar's transformation is defined by Exuberant Modernism, a creative philosophy that underpins all aspects of the brand. It embraces bold designs, unexpected and original thinking, creating a brand character that will command attention through fearless creativity.",
      "Jaguar Type 01's exuberant modernist design, pioneering technology and instinctive driving dynamics will underpin future Jaguar models. It forms part of JLR's portfolio of distinctive British brands.",
      "ABOUT JAGUAR AT KNIGHTSBRIDGEOpening hours:Monday ‑ Saturday 10am ‑ 8pm Sunday 11am ‑ 6pm",
      "Please note vehicle sales will be appointment only and opening hours are subject to change. Important notice JLR is constantly seeking ways to improve the specification, design and production of its vehicles, parts and accessories and alterations take place continually. Whilst every effort is made to produce up‑to‑date literature, this document should not be regarded as an infallible guide to current specifications or availability, nor does it constitute an offer for the sale of any particular vehicle, part or accessory."
